212020.png", "comment": "GO for launch on September 15 UTC.", "info_url": "https://x.com/Avio_Group/status/2082739494067786159", "created_by": "Cosmic_Penguin", "created_on": "2026-07-30T14:09:00Z"}, {"id": 15356, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/arnaud2520muller_profile_20230607144351.jpg", "comment": "NET September 11", "info_url": "https://centrespatialguyanais.cnes.fr/fr/calendrier-lancements", "created_by": "Nosu", "created_on": "2026-06-25T12:08:00Z"}, {"id": 15209, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/cosmic2520penguin_profile_20210817212020.png", "comment": "NET September 9.", "info_url": "https://centrespatialguyanais.cnes.fr/fr/calendrier-lancements", "created_by": "Cosmic_Penguin", "created_on": "2026-06-05T14:22:00Z"}, {"id": 13600, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/cosmic2520penguin_profile_20210817212020.png", "comment": "NET September 1st, together with FLEX.", "info_url": "https://earth.esa.int/eogateway/announcement-of-opportunity/flex-cal-val", "created_by": "Cosmic_Penguin", "created_on": "2026-01-11T21:34:00Z"}, {"id": 13157, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/arnaud2520muller_profile_20230607144351.jpg", "comment": "NET October 2026", "info_url": "https://database.eohandbook.com/database/missionsummary.aspx?missionID=579", "created_by": "Nosu", "created_on": "2025-12-06T07:23:00Z"}, {"id": 12796, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/cosmic2520penguin_profile_20210817212020.png", "comment": "NET September 2026. (see 02:17:55 mark)", "info_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6daC_wTrjS0", "created_by": "Cosmic_Penguin", "created_on": "2025-11-06T23:58:00Z"}, {"id": 12256, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/arnaud2520muller_profile_20230607144351.jpg", "comment": "NET June 2026", "info_url": "https://database.eohandbook.com/database/missionsummary.aspx?missionID=579", "created_by": "Nosu", "created_on": "2025-09-15T11:37:00Z"}, {"id": 7639, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/arnaud2520muller_profile_20230607144351.jpg", "comment": "NET 2026", "info_url": "https://space.oscar.wmo.int/satellites/view/sentinel_3c", "created_by": "Nosu", "created_on": "2024-05-27T14:32:38Z"}, {"id": 6993, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/cosmic2520penguin_profile_20210817212020.png", "comment": "NET Q1 2025.", "info_url": "https://www.eumetsat.int/planned-launches", "created_by": "Cosmic_Penguin", "created_on": "2024-03-15T13:01:16Z"}, {"id": 2872, "profile_image": "https://thespacedevs-prod.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/media/profile_images/arnaud2520muller_profile_20230607144351.jpg", "comment": "Adding launch NET October 2024", "info_url": "https://database.eohandbook.com/database/agencysummary.aspx?agencyID=9", "created_by": "Nosu", "created_on": "2022-11-21T20:28:56Z"}], "info_urls": [{"priority": 10, "source": "avio.com", "title": "LAUNCH KIT VV30", "description": "Launch Kit VV30", "feature_image": null, "url": "https://www.avio.com/press-kit/launch-kit-vv-30", "type": {"id": 2, "name": "Official Press Kit"}, "language": {"id": 1, "name": "English", "code": "en"}}], "vid_urls": [{"priority": 10, "source": "youtube.com", "publisher": "Avio SpA", "title": "Vega C | Flight VV30 | Sentinel-3C - FLEX | Avio", "description": "On September 14th at 10.21 PM Kourou time (01.21 UTC; 03.21 AM CEST on September 15th), Avio will launch two Earth observation satellites: the Sentinel-3C of the Copernicus programme for the European Commission and the FLEX Earth Explorer for the European Space Agency (ESA). The mission, designated \u201cVV30\u201d, will be carried out by a Vega C launcher, the second operated by Avio, lifting off from the European Spaceport in French Guiana.\n \nThe satellites will be released into Sun-Synchronous Orbit at an altitude of about 820 km with an inclination of 98.6\u00b0. The duration of the launch (from lift-off to separation of the last satellite) is 116 minutes.\n \nCopernicus Sentinel-3C is the third satellite of the Sentinel-3 mission, dedicated to monitoring the health of our planet by observing ocea...", "feature_image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Rb4CN2avz90/maxresdefault.jpg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rb4CN2avz90", "type": {"id": 1, "name": "Official Webcast"}, "language": {"id": 1, "name": "English", "code": "en"}, "start_time": "2026-09-15T00:47:26Z", "end_time": "2026-09-15T03:40:32Z", "live": false}, {"priority": 11, "source": "youtube.com", "publisher": "European Space Agency, ESA", "title": "FLEX and Sentinel-3C launch (Official broadcast)", "description": "ESA\u2019s FLEX satellite and the Copernicus Sentinel-3C satellite are set to launch on 15 September at 03:21 CEST (14 September at 22:21 local time). Watch the launch programme live from Europe\u2019s Spaceport in French Guiana, with streaming starting at 02:50 CEST and continuing until 05:36 CEST.\n\nFLEX will provide new insights into how plants function by measuring the faint fluorescence they emit as they capture sunlight during photosynthesis. This unique measurement will help scientists better understand plant health and productivity, as well as how vegetation responds to a changing environment.\n\nSentinel-3C is the third satellite in the Sentinel-3 mission, which systematically monitors Earth\u2019s oceans, land, ice and atmosphere. The mission as a whole contributes to a better understanding o...", "feature_image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fmrgyh5s-is/maxresdefault.jpg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fmrgyh5s-is", "type": {"id": 1, "name": "Official Webcast"}, "language": {"id": 1, "name": "English", "code": "en"}, "start_time": "2026-09-15T00:48:56Z", "end_time": "2026-09-15T03:40:39Z", "live": false}, {"priority": 12, "source": "youtube.com", "publisher": "NASASpaceflight", "title": "Vega C launches Sentinel-3C & FLEX", "description": "Launch: 9:21:07 PM Eastern\n\nMission overview:\nhttps://www.nasaspaceflight.com/2026/09/vega-c-launch-sentinel-3c-flex/\n\n\u26a1 Become a member of NASASpaceflight's channel for exclusive discord access, fast turnaround clips, and other exclusive benefits. Your support helps us continue our 24/7 coverage. \u26a1\n\n\ud83d\udd0d If you are interested in using footage captured by this stream, please review our content use policy: https://www.nasaspaceflight.com/content-use-policy/\n\n#Ariane6 #Arianespace #ESA #Space  #SatelliteLaunch #SpaceLaunch #ArianeRocket #LEOConstellation #FrenchGuiana \n\n\ud83c\udfb5 Intro song: New Way Out by Denis. Licensed via PremiumBeat. LDAPAABJRG2UMCU3\n\ud83c\udfb5 Music used on streams and in videos is licensed via EpidemicSound: https://share.epidemicsound.com/qvh38e\n\nAll content copyright NASASpaceflig...", "feature_image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_7nBPHF-hAE/maxresdefault.jpg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_7nBPHF-hAE", "type": {"id": 3, "name": "Unofficial Webcast"}, "language": {"id": 1, "name": "English", "code": "en"}, "start_time": "2026-09-15T00:25:07Z", "end_time": "2026-09-15T01:46:40Z", "live": false}], "timeline": [{"type": {"id": 10, "abbrev": "Liftoff", "description": "First upwards movement of the rocket"}, "relative_time": "P0D"}, {"type": {"id": 13, "abbrev": "Stage 2 Separation", "description": "Separation of the second stage from the first"}, "relative_time": "PT2M27S"}, {"type": {"id": 31, "abbrev": "SES", "description": "Start of the second engine"}, "relative_time": "PT2M28S"}, {"type": {"id": 74, "abbrev": "Stage 3 Separation", "description": "Separation of the third stage from the second"}, "relative_time": "PT4M32S"}, {"type": {"id": 75, "abbrev": "Stage 3 Ignition", "de